#: ../../source/configuration.rst:475
msgid "Abstract interfaces"
msgstr "抽象接口"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:477
msgid ""
"Abstract interfaces can't be implemented by parts directly. They also "
"can't be used for mating with other interfaces. They are a convenience "
"feature so that a property can be implemented once but inherited multiple"
" times by all child interfaces."
msgstr "抽象接口不能被零件直接实现。它们也不能用于与其他接口配合。它们是一种便利特性，使得某个属性只需实现一次，就能被所有子接口多次继承。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:483
msgid "Port visualization"
msgstr "端口可视化"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:485
msgid ""
"When a part or an assembly is rendered (in a GUI or when exported to a "
"file), the ports can be visualized. When ports are visualized, each port "
"looks like a coordinate system (3D location, direction and rotation) and,"
" optionally, as a 2D image of an alleged \"boundary\" (or \"siluette\") "
"of the port."
msgstr "当零件或装配体被渲染时（在图形界面中，或导出到文件时），可以将端口可视化。端口被可视化时，每个端口看起来像一个坐标系（三维位置、方向和旋转），并可选地表现为该端口所谓“边界”（或“轮廓”）的二维图像。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:490
msgid ""
"It is recommended to define the port boundary at all times. Here is an "
"example how to define the port boundary using a primitive sketch:"
