#: ../../source/configuration.rst:867
msgid ""
"Each part may have a list of parameters that are passed into the scripts "
"to modify the part. The parameters can be of types ``string``, ``float``,"
" ``int`` and ``bool``. The parameter values can be restricted by "
"specifying the list of possible values in ``enum``. The initial parameter"
" value is set using ``default``."
msgstr ""
"每个零件都可以有一份参数列表，这些参数会被传入脚本以修改该零件。参数的类型可以是 ``string`` 、 ``float`` 、 ``int``"
" 和 ``bool`` 。可以通过在 ``enum`` 中指定可能取值的列表来限制参数值。参数的初始值使用 ``default`` 来设置。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:885
msgid ""
"There are several parameter names that are reserved for values used in "
"visualization, simulation calculations and, if applicable, manufacturing "
"(also referred to as ``MCFTT parameters`` using their first letters):"
msgstr "有几个参数名称是保留的，用于可视化、仿真计算以及（如适用）制造中所使用的值（取其首字母，也被称为 ``MCFTT parameters`` ）："

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:889
msgid "``material``"
msgstr "``material``"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:891
msgid ""
"Must point at an object of type ``material``. Some of them are defined in"
" ``//pub/std/manufacturing/material``. When a request is made to a "
"manufacturing API, a close enough material is selected from the materials"
" provided by the manufacturer. The responsibility to select the right "
"material is on the implementation of the manufacturing API (the "
"``provider`` object in PartCAD)."
msgstr ""
"必须指向一个类型为 ``material`` 的对象。其中一些定义在 ``//pub/std/manufacturing/material`` "
"中。当向某个制造 API 发出请求时，会从制造商提供的材料中选出一种足够接近的材料。选择正确材料的责任在于该制造 API 的实现（即 "
"PartCAD 中的 ``provider`` 对象）。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:898
msgid "**Not implemented yet. Use hardcoded values for now.**"
msgstr "**尚未实现。目前请使用硬编码的值。**"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:900
msgid "``color``"
msgstr "``color``"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:902
msgid "**Not implemented yet. Use color names for now.**"
msgstr "**尚未实现。目前请使用颜色名称。**"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:904
msgid "``finish``"
msgstr "``finish``"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:906
msgid "Optional. Can be omitted for no finish."
msgstr "可选。如果不需要表面处理，可以省略。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:908 ../../source/configuration.rst:914
#: ../../source/configuration.rst:920
msgid "**Not implemented yet.**"
msgstr "**尚未实现。**"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:910
msgid "``texture``"
msgstr "``texture``"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:912
msgid "Optional. Can be omitted for no texture."
msgstr "可选。如果不需要纹理，可以省略。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:916
msgid "``tolerance``"
msgstr "``tolerance``"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:918
msgid ""
"Optional. Can be omitted for a claim to perfect precision during "
"manufacturing."
msgstr "可选。如果要声称制造过程中具有完美精度，可以省略。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:922
msgid ""
"If the part has variable MCFTT parameters depending on the surface, then "
"either this part must be broken down into multiple parts, or the values "
"must be derived from CAD files/scripts (not implemented yet). In the "
"latter case the part will not be eligible for manufacturing features, "
"unless a specific manufacturing service provider recognizes (vendor,SKU) "
"values and have received corresponding manufacturing instructions out-of-"
"band."
msgstr ""
"如果某个零件因表面不同而具有可变的 MCFTT 参数，那么要么必须将该零件拆分成多个零件，要么这些值必须从 CAD "
"文件/脚本中推导得出（尚未实现）。在后一种情况下，该零件将无法使用制造相关的功能，除非某个特定的制造服务提供方能够识别（vendor,SKU）值，并已通过带外方式收到了相应的制造说明。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:929
msgid ""
"The MCFTT parameters are not required and have no impact on parts that "
"have ``vendor`` and ``sku`` set and that are procured using providers of "
"the type ``store``."
msgstr ""
"对于已设置 ``vendor`` 和 ``sku`` 、并使用 ``store`` 类型提供方进行采购的零件，MCFTT "
"参数不是必需的，也不会对其产生任何影响。"

