#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1096 ../../source/configuration.rst:1142
msgid ""
"Get a quote for the specific cart of parts. Quote API is the core of the "
"provider. It is expected to return the price of a cart."
msgstr "为特定的零件购物车获取报价。报价 API 是提供方的核心，它应当返回一个购物车的价格。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1100 ../../source/configuration.rst:1146
msgid "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"]`: the dictionary of parts"
msgstr "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"]`：零件的字典"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1101
msgid "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"vendor\"]`: the vendor of the part"
msgstr "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"vendor\"]`：该零件的供应商"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1102
msgid "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"sku\"]`: the SKU of the part"
msgstr "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"sku\"]`：该零件的 SKU"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1103
msgid ""
"`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"count\"]`: the requested quantity "
"of the parts"
msgstr "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"count\"]`：所请求的零件数量"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1104
msgid ""
"`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"count_per_sku\"]`: the known number"
" of parts per SKU"
msgstr "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"count_per_sku\"]`：每个 SKU 已知包含的零件数量"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1105 ../../source/configuration.rst:1149
msgid "`output[\"price\"]`: the total price of the cart"
msgstr "`output[\"price\"]`：购物车的总价"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1106 ../../source/configuration.rst:1150
msgid "`output[\"cartId\"]`: the id of the cart (to be used for the order later)"
msgstr "`output[\"cartId\"]`：购物车的 id（稍后用于下单）"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1108 ../../source/configuration.rst:1152
msgid "`request[\"api\"] == \"order\"`"
msgstr "`request[\"api\"] == \"order\"`"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1110 ../../source/configuration.rst:1154
msgid ""
"Order the specific quote. Order API does not need to be implemented as "
"there is no infrastructure for payments yet."
msgstr "对特定的报价下单。由于目前还没有支付相关的基础设施，因此下单 API 无需实现。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1114 ../../source/configuration.rst:1158
msgid "`request[\"cartId\"]`: the id of the cart to be purchased"
msgstr "`request[\"cartId\"]`：要购买的购物车的 id"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1117
msgid "Manufacturer"
msgstr "Manufacturer"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1119
msgid "``manufacturer`` providers use the following input and output values:"
msgstr "``manufacturer`` 提供方使用以下输入和输出值："

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1126
msgid "Get capabilities of this provider."
msgstr "获取该提供方的能力。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1128
msgid "`output[\"materials\"]`: the dictionary of supported materials"
msgstr "`output[\"materials\"]`：所支持材料的字典"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1138
msgid "`output[\"format\"]`: the list of supported formats (e.g. `[\"step\"]`)"
msgstr "`output[\"format\"]`：所支持格式的列表（例如 `[\"step\"]` ）"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1147
msgid ""
"`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"format\"]`: the format of the "
"binary (e.g. `\"step\"`)"
msgstr "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"format\"]`：二进制数据的格式（例如 `\"step\"` ）"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1148
msgid "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"binary\"]`: the geometry data"
msgstr "`request[\"cart\"][\"parts\"][<id>][\"binary\"]`：几何数据"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1164
msgid "Repositories"
msgstr "仓库"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1166
msgid ""
"A repository plugin serves the contents of a package: its objects, its "
"child packages and its metadata. It is what backs an ``external`` "
"dependency (see `External packages`_)."
msgstr ""
"仓库插件负责提供一个包的内容：它的对象、它的子包以及它的元数据。它正是为 ``external`` 依赖提供支撑的东西（参见 `External "
"packages`_ ）。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1170
msgid "Repositories are declared in ``partcad.yaml`` using the following syntax:"
msgstr "仓库在 ``partcad.yaml`` 中使用以下语法声明："

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1184
msgid ""
"``enrich`` repositories are references to other repositories with some "
"parameters modified to specific values."
msgstr "``enrich`` 仓库是对其他仓库的引用，其中一些参数被修改为特定的值。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1187
msgid ""
"``basic`` repositories are implemented as Python scripts, invoked the "
"same way as provider scripts (via ``runpy``, with the input in the global"
" ``request`` and the output in the global ``output``). A repository "
"script answers a single, generic key/value request:"
msgstr ""
"``basic`` 仓库以 Python 脚本的形式实现，其调用方式与提供方脚本相同（通过 ``runpy`` ，输入放在全局的 "
"``request`` 中，输出放在全局的 ``output`` 中）。一个仓库脚本会响应单个通用的键/值请求："

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1192
msgid "`request[\"api\"] == \"get\"`"
msgstr "`request[\"api\"] == \"get\"`"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1193
msgid "`request[\"key\"]`: the key being requested"
msgstr "`request[\"key\"]`：所请求的键"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1194
msgid ""
"`output[\"result\"]`: the value stored under that key (or ``null`` if "
"unknown)"
msgstr "`output[\"result\"]`：存储在该键之下的值（如果未知则为 ``null`` ）"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1196
msgid ""
"The keys address every kind of data uniformly, so serving a new kind of "
"object or a new piece of metadata needs no new API:"
msgstr "这些键以统一的方式对每一种数据进行寻址，因此提供一种新类型的对象或一项新的元数据都无需新的 API："

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1199
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``objects/<kind>`` -- all objects of a kind, as ``{name: config, ...}`` "
"(kinds are ``sketch``, ``part``, ``assembly``, ``interface``, "
"``provider``, ``repository``)"
msgstr ""
"``objects/<kind>`` —— 某一种类的所有对象，形式为 ``{name: config, ...}`` （种类有 "
"``sketch`` 、 ``part`` 、 ``assembly`` 、 ``interface`` 、 ``provider`` 、 "
"``repository`` ）"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1202
msgid ""
"``objects/<kind>/<name>`` -- a single object's config, fetched without "
"listing the whole repository"
msgstr "``objects/<kind>/<name>`` —— 单个对象的配置，无需列出整个仓库即可获取"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1204
msgid "``deps`` -- the names of the child packages"
msgstr "``deps`` —— 各子包的名称"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1205
msgid ""
"``meta`` -- package-level properties (``desc``, ``render``, "
"``manufacturable``, ...)"
msgstr "``meta`` —— 包级别的属性（ ``desc`` 、 ``render`` 、 ``manufacturable`` ……）"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1207
msgid ""
"``files/<path>`` -- the base64-encoded content of a file an object "
"references by ``path``. A plugin-backed package has no source tree, so a "
"file-backed object's file is fetched from the plugin and materialized "
"into the package's cache directory when the object is built."
msgstr ""
"``files/<path>`` —— 某个对象通过 ``path`` 引用的文件的 base64 "
"编码内容。由插件支撑的包没有源代码树，因此在构建某个由文件支撑的对象时，其文件会从插件获取，并具体化到该包的缓存目录中。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1212
msgid ""
"For a hierarchy, a child package's requests are prefixed with its "
"``subfolder``: a child in ``motors`` asks for ``motors/objects/part``, "
"``motors/deps`` and so on, all served by the same script."
msgstr ""
"对于层级结构，子包的请求会以它的 ``subfolder`` 作为前缀： ``motors`` 中的一个子包会请求 "
"``motors/objects/part`` 、 ``motors/deps`` 等等，全部由同一个脚本提供服务。"

#: ../../source/configuration.rst:1216
msgid ""
"Responses are cached per key (in memory and on disk), so a repository "
"that is slow or remote is queried as little as possible. See "
"``examples/plugin_repository_basic``, ``examples/plugin_repository_full``"
" (an HTTP-backed repository) and ``examples/plugin_repository_tree`` (a "
"hierarchy)."
msgstr ""
"响应会按键进行缓存（在内存中和磁盘上），因此对于速度慢或位于远程的仓库，会尽可能少地查询它。参见 "
"``examples/plugin_repository_basic`` 、 "
"``examples/plugin_repository_full`` （一个由 HTTP 支撑的仓库）和 "
"``examples/plugin_repository_tree`` （一个层级结构）。"
